{
  "voices": {
    "primary": "af_heart",
    "secondary": "am_michael"
  },
  "speed": 0.9,
  "files": {
    "primary\nHi, Ben! How are you?": "2f975af9dc16df93.mp3",
    "secondary\nHi, Sara! I'm fine, thanks. And you?": "37e80fbeecacdf10.mp3",
    "primary\nI'm good. Do you like football?": "489cada0074092c4.mp3",
    "secondary\nYes, I do. I love football!": "7532a8fa730a0c4e.mp3",
    "primary\nMe too. What is your favorite team?": "345fe9cfad75c943.mp3",
    "secondary\nMy favorite team is Real Madrid. What about you?": "ea37dcf2a6802f93.mp3",
    "primary\nI like Barcelona.": "c8f88f3a7d8f3766.mp3",
    "secondary\nOh no! They are our rivals!": "be15b47517c57de4.mp3",
    "primary\nHa ha. Do you play football?": "bb84c5e4cfc10a26.mp3",
    "secondary\nYes, I play every Friday with my friends.": "db9bde80d4e6e189.mp3",
    "primary\nWhere do you play?": "b21380a5263a3480.mp3",
    "secondary\nWe play in the park near my house.": "3785c11e48eff3bd.mp3",
    "primary\nCan I play with you on Friday?": "aa3cbaf9d0e79c2c.mp3",
    "secondary\nSure! We start at five o’clock.": "f39fa08eed531753.mp3",
    "primary\nGreat! See you on Friday.": "a57888a50ecb54d1.mp3",
    "secondary\nSee you, Sara!": "b48f300554991ed8.mp3",
    "primary\nHello! Are you my new neighbour?": "6325ae664a713ceb.mp3",
    "secondary\nYes, I am. My name is Tom.": "aee07018abbe02a8.mp3",
    "primary\nNice to meet you, Tom. I'm Emma.": "92933ff334b7859b.mp3",
    "secondary\nNice to meet you too, Emma.": "c463a9a0dfc71c5b.mp3",
    "primary\nWhere are you from?": "9d915ef0768982d5.mp3",
    "secondary\nI'm from Canada. And you?": "ece3a58922f1815d.mp3",
    "primary\nI'm from here. I live in number twelve.": "39326040d928556b.mp3",
    "secondary\nI live in number fourteen.": "b1daa8bfc7970dce.mp3",
    "primary\nDo you live alone?": "f5986824b45e3946.mp3",
    "secondary\nNo, I live with my brother and my cat.": "4791d7364178aafc.mp3",
    "primary\nI love cats! What is its name?": "6cd3f1776b40a8b6.mp3",
    "secondary\nIts name is Milo. He is very small.": "c016bd824a1dc8ba.mp3",
    "primary\nWelcome to the street, Tom.": "7b01adbd75dd197e.mp3",
    "secondary\nThank you, Emma. Have a nice day!": "b39b23a77da0974e.mp3",
    "primary\nGood morning! What would you like?": "90933d3f747f0e6a.mp3",
    "secondary\nGood morning. A coffee, please.": "e308540e020438ba.mp3",
    "primary\nSmall or large?": "05e7ee5e75f94da0.mp3",
    "secondary\nLarge, please. With milk.": "f45adeff609d542e.mp3",
    "primary\nAnything to eat?": "7e31e51ffa303d9d.mp3",
    "secondary\nYes. Can I have a cheese sandwich?": "b9bbd04bdf44558a.mp3",
    "primary\nOf course. Is that for here or to go?": "63e7b1464f182803.mp3",
    "secondary\nFor here, please.": "ab69d231eee4c1c3.mp3",
    "primary\nThat is eight dollars.": "b09a70a84f87334e.mp3",
    "secondary\nHere you are.": "ae66d8aba94aecdf.mp3",
    "primary\nThank you. Please sit down. I will bring it to you.": "5bd8631bfb70c4a3.mp3",
    "secondary\nThanks a lot!": "b9646bbc3df38724.mp3",
    "primary\nHi, Jack. Did you have a good weekend?": "9104baf442a6a4d4.mp3",
    "secondary\nYes, it was great, thanks. And you?": "a436051b39603323.mp3",
    "primary\nIt was quiet. What did you do?": "cc54c6fe7f6e9234.mp3",
    "secondary\nOn Saturday I went to the mountains with my family.": "60cf891212277118.mp3",
    "primary\nThat sounds nice! Was it cold?": "d68b75785e04c3e6.mp3",
    "secondary\nA little. But the weather was sunny, so we walked for three hours.": "a96500fe6525d9e6.mp3",
    "primary\nWow, that is a long walk.": "0306e4e371d5f8bd.mp3",
    "secondary\nYes, I was very tired in the evening. What about you?": "1feca512e1d3c39d.mp3",
    "primary\nI stayed at home on Saturday and cleaned my flat.": "a00bd8517680a62b.mp3",
    "secondary\nAnd on Sunday?": "b44a5acbc188ce99.mp3",
    "primary\nI met some friends and we watched a film.": "0d337af8e0fc4ba2.mp3",
    "secondary\nWhich film did you see?": "2d6d75890539d843.mp3",
    "primary\nA comedy. It was really funny.": "2cd8be9a5be0320c.mp3",
    "secondary\nMaybe I can watch it next weekend.": "0ec003373f6c28e7.mp3",
    "primary\nGood afternoon. How can I help you?": "89c0b5e80e75cf5a.mp3",
    "secondary\nHello, doctor. I don't feel very well.": "72b41bd2c86232f9.mp3",
    "primary\nWhat is the problem?": "5e09d7cc61a64db6.mp3",
    "secondary\nI have a sore throat and a headache.": "eca14c329f3cf16d.mp3",
    "primary\nHow long have you had them?": "29333583d8d50955.mp3",
    "secondary\nSince Monday. I also feel tired all the time.": "1789095788d1bb0d.mp3",
    "primary\nDo you have a temperature?": "f05b474ba78385ad.mp3",
    "secondary\nYes, I think so. I feel hot at night.": "0859a5d1e9f8dd92.mp3",
    "primary\nLet me check. Open your mouth, please.": "70c67ef149836525.mp3",
    "secondary\nIs it serious?": "69ca051810358eb1.mp3",
    "primary\nNo, it is just a cold. You need to rest and drink a lot of water.": "5ef1ab7b04598af0.mp3",
    "secondary\nCan I go to work tomorrow?": "de0fd83cbe2384c8.mp3",
    "primary\nIt is better to stay at home for two days.": "a56ba532084ee4d8.mp3",
    "secondary\nThank you, doctor.": "e9313710222df975.mp3",
    "primary\nExcuse me. Can you help me?": "0a6c5f78f18e22df.mp3",
    "secondary\nSure. What are you looking for?": "52e95245d06ae101.mp3",
    "primary\nHow can I get to the train station?": "84bfc7fe7cf51ded.mp3",
    "secondary\nIt is not far. Go straight on and turn left at the bank.": "50a51ae6b01fd601.mp3",
    "primary\nTurn left at the bank. And then?": "3ce6fa6c9bfd5148.mp3",
    "secondary\nWalk past the supermarket. The station is on your right.": "1066487d3a8941c1.mp3",
    "primary\nHow long does it take to walk there?": "157284ff321984cd.mp3",
    "secondary\nAbout ten minutes.": "95a1aea7f6d40790.mp3",
    "primary\nIs there a bus?": "10f72c6f063b4cb9.mp3",
    "secondary\nYes, the number five bus goes there, but walking is faster now.": "5866c08e891bee1a.mp3",
    "primary\nGreat. Thank you very much!": "d41a4195ee5ea777.mp3",
    "secondary\nYou are welcome. Have a good trip!": "e91c53a3fc34e5d8.mp3",
    "primary\nThank you for coming in today. Could you tell me a little about yourself?": "055a8c4b0a93988b.mp3",
    "secondary\nOf course. I studied business, and for the last three years I have worked in sales.": "8dcbad1515b8eaac.mp3",
    "primary\nWhy are you interested in this position?": "25de0e9a79cc3a63.mp3",
    "secondary\nI enjoy working with customers, and I would like to work for a company that is growing.": "6998a0b4f97790ef.mp3",
    "primary\nWhat would you say is your biggest strength?": "52cbdb8d578cbc4c.mp3",
    "secondary\nI am well organised. I always plan my week and I rarely miss a deadline.": "39080c4dabfa19f1.mp3",
    "primary\nAnd what about a weakness?": "135124f8a0c0afd0.mp3",
    "secondary\nSometimes I try to do everything myself, but I am learning to ask my team for help.": "a92bea754f9bd71e.mp3",
    "primary\nCan you tell me about a difficult situation at work?": "19b7674f9600e736.mp3",
    "secondary\nOnce a customer was very angry about a late delivery. I listened, apologised and found a solution the same day.": "69aa1437220de6bc.mp3",
    "primary\nThat is a good example. Do you have any questions for us?": "6240941d42c42876.mp3",
    "secondary\nYes. What does a typical day look like in this role?": "5d5f551215ed70c1.mp3",
    "primary\nYou would spend most of the day talking to clients and preparing offers.": "13c710e19d141fdb.mp3",
    "secondary\nThat sounds interesting. Thank you for your time.": "9a52aa3564b76623.mp3",
    "primary\nGood evening. How can I help you?": "34056975af1c0f13.mp3",
    "secondary\nHi. I'm in room 305, and I'm afraid there's a problem with the air conditioning.": "223ffe8421614c6b.mp3",
    "primary\nI'm sorry to hear that. What seems to be the problem?": "e076028bb2e259d8.mp3",
    "secondary\nIt doesn't work at all, and the room is really hot.": "ce2d10b3dfb416fc.mp3",
    "primary\nI will send someone from maintenance right away.": "9405eef286a0730c.mp3",
    "secondary\nThank you. How long will it take?": "ee475bcdc39f6518.mp3",
    "primary\nUsually about twenty minutes, but it depends on the problem.": "ddca17ac23b069f1.mp3",
    "secondary\nI've had a long day, and I'd really like to get some sleep.": "958cb62e756a947f.mp3",
    "primary\nI understand. If it can’t be fixed quickly, we can move you to another room.": "d58e65462e24920b.mp3",
    "secondary\nThat would be great. Is there one available?": "c85cd21500217fd6.mp3",
    "primary\nYes, we have a room on the fifth floor with a view of the sea.": "1238e8d1ff5dee71.mp3",
    "secondary\nPerfect. I'll pack my things.": "cb5412f782494e4f.mp3",
    "primary\nAnd breakfast tomorrow is on us, to apologise for the trouble.": "8174782d0af66ebd.mp3",
    "secondary\nThat's very kind of you. Thanks a lot.": "2a90cd2f36a3e42f.mp3",
    "primary\nHey, Ryan! Are you doing anything on Saturday?": "921837a8b67edfc7.mp3",
    "secondary\nNothing special yet. Why, what's up?": "9e120a27aa59d099.mp3",
    "primary\nThere's a food festival in the city centre. Do you fancy going?": "0f806f2028f2d798.mp3",
    "secondary\nSounds good! What time were you thinking of?": "fd9f518d42c6715a.mp3",
    "primary\nHow about meeting at noon? Then we can have lunch there.": "4348a38e1e9e684f.mp3",
    "secondary\nNoon works for me. Should we invite anyone else?": "6370b1ebb7123f46.mp3",
    "primary\nLet's ask Mike and Julia. They love trying new food.": "01a0a2c2eddb2184.mp3",
    "secondary\nGood idea. I'll send them a message.": "2c87f27634dab903.mp3",
    "primary\nShould we go by car or take the metro?": "546b063c7270f05f.mp3",
    "secondary\nThe metro is easier. Parking will be a nightmare.": "bf350ba9ae48f5ca.mp3",
    "primary\nTrue. Let's meet at the station, then.": "f1de226bb9ef7869.mp3",
    "secondary\nPerfect. If it rains, we can go to the cinema instead.": "daa53b23de4478de.mp3",
    "primary\nDeal. I'll check the weather on Friday night.": "85a6d7431cc14985.mp3",
    "secondary\nSee you on Saturday!": "d9e8806b4c3b0951.mp3",
    "primary\nSo, how are you finding working from home? It's been a few months now.": "3d1602824543cc51.mp3",
    "secondary\nHonestly, it's a mixed bag. I save almost two hours a day on commuting, which is fantastic.": "e499d9dcea46465b.mp3",
    "primary\nI can imagine. But don't you miss being around people?": "e86e2bf827ae420c.mp3",
    "secondary\nI do, more than I expected. Video calls just aren't the same as a quick chat by the coffee machine.": "0759ec1a7f609fa3.mp3",
    "primary\nThat's exactly how I feel. And I find it hard to switch off in the evening.": "285bfd459a1b50d2.mp3",
    "secondary\nSame here. My laptop is always there on the kitchen table, tempting me to check my emails.": "d34677e088a0157c.mp3",
    "primary\nHave you found anything that helps?": "40268b813f4b4344.mp3",
    "secondary\nI've started going for a short walk at six. It's like my way of leaving the office.": "d4a9402b65e9a74d.mp3",
    "primary\nThat's a clever idea. I might try that myself.": "03bd6cfddf6ef721.mp3",
    "secondary\nWhat about your team? Are they happy with the arrangement?": "4124d6e715f4fdb2.mp3",
    "primary\nMost of them are, but a couple of the younger ones would rather be in the office.": "5312027d7fd35d26.mp3",
    "secondary\nThat makes sense. They're probably still learning a lot from colleagues.": "176fed3539aba75a.mp3",
    "primary\nExactly. We're thinking of having everyone come in on Tuesdays and Thursdays.": "2de30ae1218bdf21.mp3",
    "secondary\nA hybrid model sounds like the best of both worlds.": "f8c16eddf7eac03c.mp3",
    "primary\nHi, I bought this laptop here two weeks ago, and it keeps shutting down without any warning.": "0e4749f3047153d0.mp3",
    "secondary\nI'm sorry about that. Have you got the receipt with you?": "21d55b23818b640e.mp3",
    "primary\nYes, here it is. I've also tried updating everything, but it didn't make any difference.": "e8d9939284cacfa7.mp3",
    "secondary\nThanks. Does it happen when you're using a particular program?": "a13ceff65c99ed35.mp3",
    "primary\nNot really. It can happen when I am just writing an email.": "93646fb4a2981bae.mp3",
    "secondary\nThat sounds like a hardware fault. We can send it for repair, which usually takes about ten days.": "e64304f7c56c0b7f.mp3",
    "primary\nTo be honest, I'd rather not wait that long. I need it for work.": "69867dcf6d638863.mp3",
    "secondary\nI understand. Since it is still within thirty days, you are entitled to a replacement.": "68ce4661244dccad.mp3",
    "primary\nThat would be much better. Is the same model in stock?": "926caee3b521cac4.mp3",
    "secondary\nLet me check. Yes, we've got one left.": "f1f0826bd1a0abf7.mp3",
    "primary\nGreat. And will my files be transferred?": "cf73001f46aab9a8.mp3",
    "secondary\nI'm afraid we can't do that here, but if you back them up first, you won't lose anything.": "58be57820f5b8831.mp3",
    "primary\nFair enough. I'll do that tonight and come back tomorrow.": "7672fbe5c5f31e49.mp3",
    "secondary\nNo problem. I'll put the replacement aside for you.": "95c03bdc532f7d2f.mp3",
    "primary\nYou look exhausted. How was your trip to Lisbon?": "74c8bb23b72c213c.mp3",
    "secondary\nDon't ask. Pretty much everything that could go wrong, went wrong.": "ae6906a40121abc4.mp3",
    "primary\nOh no. What happened?": "d99ecddf1e538d67.mp3",
    "secondary\nFirst, our flight was delayed by five hours, so we missed our connection in Madrid.": "ad9f7d8f3c91c038.mp3",
    "primary\nThat's awful. Did the airline put you up in a hotel?": "8e40f22820605b2a.mp3",
    "secondary\nEventually, yes, but we had to queue for ages before anyone would help us.": "437f34973688577e.mp3",
    "primary\nAnd did you make it to Lisbon in the end?": "5e3c5fae4e154b02.mp3",
    "secondary\nWe did, a day late. And then we found out our luggage had stayed in Madrid.": "34c6d0da4fdb1a57.mp3",
    "primary\nYou're kidding! What did you do without your clothes?": "7b7956254640fc02.mp3",
    "secondary\nWe had to buy a few basics. Luckily the shops near the hotel were open late.": "a52c3472d8b154c1.mp3",
    "primary\nAt least the city itself was nice, I hope?": "b0a891793c30e24e.mp3",
    "secondary\nIt was wonderful, actually. The food, the views, the people were all amazing.": "00685f0afcde59d7.mp3",
    "primary\nSo it wasn't a complete disaster after all.": "e9719257240ae7c1.mp3",
    "secondary\nNo. Looking back, it's a funny story. But I'm taking hand luggage only next time!": "4a3c8a40003f1e27.mp3"
  }
}
